{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is approached, then take object and process it. Otherwise, if object is visible, then move towards it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
